<section class="page-intro">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">ONE-LINK REGISTRATION</p><h1>Add a project</h1><p>Register an existing website without changing its backend or database.</p></div>
  <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects">← Back to projects</a>
</section>

<section class="add-project-layout">
  <div class="panel add-project-panel">
    <div class="panel-icon">↗</div>
    <p class="eyebrow">CONNECT YOUR WEBSITE</p>
    <h2>Paste your website link</h2>
    <p class="muted-copy">Add the public link to your website’s admin dashboard. The portal checks that it responds and then opens its project workspace.</p>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="form-alert" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <form action="/projects" method="post" class="stack-form" data-busy-form>
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
      <label for="admin-url">Admin dashboard link</label>
      <input id="admin-url" type="text" name="adminUrl" value="<%= value || '' %>" placeholder="example.com/admin" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" required maxlength="2048" spellcheck="false">
      <small class="field-help">Paste the full link, or type a domain like <code>example.com/admin</code>. We add https:// automatically.</small>
      <button class="button button-primary button-wide" type="submit"><span>Add website</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      <p class="form-note">No password or database access is needed. The website must be public and support HTTPS.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
  <aside class="panel process-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow">3 SIMPLE STEPS</p>
    <ol class="process-list">
      <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Paste the admin link</strong><p>Use the website’s public admin page, such as <code>example.com/admin</code>.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><strong>We check it</strong><p>The portal checks the secure link and creates your project card.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Open your project</strong><p>Use the workspace link to visit the original dashboard.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="callout callout-info"><strong>Want more than a project link?</strong><p>Embedding and activity notifications need a small setup in the website itself. The portal never bypasses its sign-in or copies its database.</p><a class="text-link" href="/integration-guide">See the simple integration guide →</a></div>
  </aside>
</section>
